From 2c772dbbb7c43eb78d6f624c48171afbf216a1d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 08:20:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Tamer looks: the skin in five more tones

The hands' byte of the tamer's state keeps the skin above its first bit: 0 his own, then five tones, each a red,
green and blue factor over every colour of skin. Those are tones of the hands', the face's and the original sleeves'
palette rows, and the ones a garment's recipe marks as bare skin (way 5). The Look page gains the Skin row.
---
